:: start default
> @s96sqwp
  The relay wakes.
! immediate focus_camera(relay)
> @prompt
  What do you do?
  ? @inspect_relay
    Inspect the relay.
    -> relay
  ? requires=(has_key(relay_key)) @t55ekp5
    Open the locked relay cabinet.
    -> locked

:: relay
> @relay_line
  The relay is warm.
! blocking grant_item(relay_key)
> @after_key
  The relay key clicks free.
! deferred mark_seen(relay)
-> END

:: locked
> @locked_line
  The cabinet opens.
-> END
